sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Member
  participant UI as Next.js / PWA
  participant API as Daily Focus Route
  participant App as DailyFocus Use Case
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Outbox as Outbox Relay
  participant Q as QStash

  U->>UI: Save today's priorities
  UI->>API: PUT /api/v1/daily-plans/{date}<br/>If-Match + Idempotency-Key
  API->>API: Authenticate, authorize, validate
  API->>App: Execute UpdateDailyPlan command
  App->>DB: Transaction: lock plan/version
  App->>App: Enforce <= 3 primaries and capacity rules
  App->>DB: Update plan + append outbox event + idempotency result
  DB-->>App: Commit
  App-->>API: Plan DTO + new ETag
  API-->>UI: 200 OK
  UI-->>U: Optimistic state confirmed
  Outbox->>DB: Claim unpublished events with SKIP LOCKED
  Outbox->>Q: Publish DailyPlanUpdated
  Q-->>Outbox: Message id
  Outbox->>DB: Mark published
  Q->>API: Signed internal projection job
  API->>DB: Update dashboard / analytics projection idempotently

  alt Concurrent stale update
    App-->>API: version_conflict
    API-->>UI: 412 + current ETag and merge hints
    UI-->>U: Review differences without silent last-write-wins
  end
